WeatherHub Client Environment Variables
Copy this file to `.env` and fill in the values.
# Vite exposes only variables prefixed with VITE_ to the browser.

# URL of the WeatherHub backend API.
# - In development with Vite's proxy, you can leave this empty (requests go to /api → localhost:5000).
# - In production (Vercel), set this to your deployed backend URL:
VITE_API_URL=https://weatherhub-mdip.onrender.com
#   (note: no trailing slash — the client appends /api)

